and-grounding-necessity\tMetaphysical Belief Change and Grounding Necessity\t8\tsource-04-psychedelics-alter-metaphysical-beliefs--0d1ce18240f0,source-01-grounding-necessary-or-contingent--6e8195a096f0\ntopic-nonphysicalist-belief-and-truthmaking-structure\tNon-Physicalist Belief and Truthmaking Structure\t8\tsource-04-psychedelics-alter-metaphysical-beliefs--0d1ce18240f0,source-02-grounding-is-not-a-strict-order--7c76f525b4e3\ntopic-self-knowledge-without-episodic-ownership\tSelf-Knowledge Without Episodic Ownership\t7\tsource-05-memory-and-the-sense-of-personal-identity--a1fbe0966ca4,source-03-grounding-essence-and-identity--e857615fb05e\ntopic-truthmaking-facts-and-nonfactive-identity\tTruthmaking, Facts, and Non-Factive Identity\t6\tsource-03-grounding-essence-and-identity--e857615fb05e,source-02-grounding-is-not-a-strict-order--7c76f525b4e3\ntruthmaking-full-grounding-and-explanatory-connection\tTruthmaking, Full Grounding, and Explanatory Connection\t10\tsource-01-grounding-necessary-or-contingent--6e8195a096f0,source-02-grounding-is-not-a-strict-order--7c76f525b4e3\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
