{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"set -euo pipefail\nCTX=/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/metaphysics/outputs/space_overview/subspace--metaphysics/context.json\njq -r '.relations[] | [.relation_type, (.source_claim_id // .from_claim_id // .subject_claim_id // .claim_id // \\\"\\\"), (.target_claim_id // .to_claim_id // .object_claim_id // .related_claim_id // \\\"\\\"), (.description // .text // .rationale // \\\"\\\")] | @tsv' \\\"\"'$CTX\" | sed -n '\"'1,40p'\"","aggregated_output":"derived_from\t\t\tThe self-grounding construction depends on the alethic-fact grounding framework.\nderived_from\t\t\tThe factual grounding definition is the grounding half of the proposed unification.\nderived_from\t\t\tThe full generic essence definition is one half of the source’s unified identity-based account.\nderived_from\t\t\tDurability at six months is derived from the same non-physicalist belief shift measured prospectively.\nderived_from\t\t\tThe partial essence definition extends generalized identity to partial essential structure.\nderived_from\t\t\tThe demand for sharper quasi-memory criteria follows from treating R.B.'s recollections as a possible existence proof.\nsimilar\t\t\tBoth claims connect movement away from materialism with positive mental-health or clinical-response outcomes.\nsupports\t\t\tThe significance principle supplies the first substantive premise in the proof that grounding is necessary.\nsupports\t\t\tThe subsumption account reformulates the grounding analysis with a relevance-sensitive analogue.\nsupports\t\t\tIf alethic-fact grounding is a grounding species, its formal failures bear on grounding itself.\nsupports\t\t\tThe counterexample diagnosis defends the necessity thesis by preserving the distinction between full grounds, partial grounds, and non-grounds.\nsupports\t\t\tThe essence principle supplies the essential-truth bridge from cognitive insignificance to entailment.\nsupports\t\t\tUnowned yet non-delusional autobiographical scenes supply the case used against Schechtman's dilemma.\nsupports\t\t\tThe dissociation between episodic content and ownership motivates the two-component account of identity sense.\nsupports\t\t\tThe non-factive no-difference operator supplies the common analytical tool used to unify grounding and essence.\nsupports\t\t\tThe necessitation derivation illustrates how the identity account links grounding to essence.\nsupports\t\t\tThe randomized psilocybin comparison independently reproduces the predicted movement away from hard materialism.\nsupports\t\t\tThe necessity example supports the need for an essence account stronger than modal entailment.\nsupports\t\t\tParadigm grounding cases motivate treating cognitive insignificance as a general constraint on grounding.\nsupports\t\t\tLarger effects among first-time psychedelic users strengthen the inference that new psychedelic exposure contributes to belief change.\nsupports\t\t\tA plausible social-experiential pathway makes the causal interpretation more coherent while preserving contextual limits.\nsupports\t\t\tR.B.'s retained cognitive abilities narrow the deficit to ownership rather than episodic recall as a whole.\nsupports\t\t\tThe contrastive-grounding reply fails to preserve strict orderhood.\nsupports\t\t\tThe integrated proof directly establishes the article’s necessity thesis for full grounding.\nsupports\t\t\tIf mineness is generated by a contingent subsystem, memory's evidential role must be assessed through that subsystem.\nsupports\t\t\tMutual truthmaking and truth-fact grounding supply cases against asymmetry.\nsupports\t\t\tIf truthmaking is a grounding species, its non-transitivity bears on grounding's strict-order status.\nsupports\t\t\tSelf-truthmaking supplies a case against irreflexivity.\nsupports\t\t\tThe truthmaking chain supplies the source's positive case against transitivity.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
